{"id":"H6663","lemma":"צָדֵק","transliteration":"tsadaq","sayIt":"tsa-daq","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to justify","meaning":"1) to be just, be righteous\n1a) (Qal)\n1a1) to have a just cause, be in the right\n1a2) to be justified\n1a3) to be just (of God)\n1a4) to be just, be righteous (in conduct and character)\n1b) (Niphal) to be put or made right, be justified\n1c) (Piel) justify, make to appear righteous, make someone righteous\n1d) (Hiphil)\n1d1) to do or bring justice (in administering law)\n1d2) to declare righteous, justify\n1d3) to justify, vindicate the cause of, save\n1d4) to make righteous, turn to righteousness\n1e) (Hithpael) to justify oneself","glosses":["righteous","more righteous","justifying","right","vindicated","can we justify ourselves"],"count":40,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"She is more righteous","kjv":"She hath been more righteous"}},{"chapterId":"gen-44","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"can we justify ourselves","kjv":"or how shall we clear ourselves"}},{"chapterId":"exo-23","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"acquit","kjv":"for I will not justify"}},{"chapterId":"deu-25","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"may be acquitted","kjv":"then they shall justify"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-15","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"I would give him justice","kjv":"and I would do him justice"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-8","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"and justifying","kjv":"and justifying"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-6","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"and justifying","kjv":"and by justifying"}},{"chapterId":"job-4","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"be more righteous","kjv":"be more just"}},{"chapterId":"job-9","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"righteous before","kjv":"be just"}},{"chapterId":"job-9","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"I were right","kjv":"though I were righteous"}},{"chapterId":"job-9","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"I were righteous","kjv":"If I justify"}},{"chapterId":"job-10","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"And even if I am righteous","kjv":"and if I be righteous"}},{"chapterId":"job-11","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"vindicated"}},{"chapterId":"job-13","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"will be vindicated"}},{"chapterId":"job-15","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"he should be righteous"}},{"chapterId":"job-22","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"you are righteous","kjv":"that thou art righteous"}},{"chapterId":"job-25","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"be just","kjv":"be justified"}},{"chapterId":"job-27","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"that you are right","kjv":"that I should justify"}},{"chapterId":"job-32","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"justifying","kjv":"because he justified"}},{"chapterId":"job-33","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"right","kjv":"in this thou art not just"}},{"chapterId":"job-33","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"to vindicate you"}},{"chapterId":"job-34","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"I am righteous","kjv":"I am righteous"}},{"chapterId":"job-35","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"you are righteous","kjv":"If thou be righteous"}},{"chapterId":"job-40","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"justify yourself"}},{"chapterId":"psa-19","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"righteous","kjv":"and righteous"}},{"chapterId":"psa-51","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"You may be proved right","kjv":"that thou mightest be justified"}},{"chapterId":"psa-82","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"uphold the rights","kjv":"do justice"}},{"chapterId":"psa-143","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"is righteous"}},{"chapterId":"pro-17","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Acquitting","kjv":"He that justifieth"}},{"chapterId":"isa-5","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"who acquit","kjv":"Which justify"}},{"chapterId":"isa-43","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"to vindicate them","kjv":"that they may be justified"}},{"chapterId":"isa-43","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"may be vindicated"}},{"chapterId":"isa-45","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"will be justified","kjv":"be justified"}},{"chapterId":"isa-50","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"The One who vindicates Me","kjv":"that justifieth"}},{"chapterId":"isa-53","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"will justify","kjv":"justify"}},{